{%- comment -%}
  Bush Riding navigation — two deliberately different systems.

  Desktop (>= 990px): a fixed bone rail down the left, 196px wide with a
  hairline edge. Wordmark and nav at the top, the active page marked by a mist
  bar; the rail's lower half changes per template (filters on the catalogue,
  the dispatch index on the journal, the section index on a page) and its foot
  carries the next ride and the cart. The changing lower half is the whole
  argument for the rail over a top bar — it is a persistent object beside the
  content, not a strip above it.

  Mobile (< 990px): the rail collapses to two floating chips at the bottom of
  the screen — Menu and Cart — with the menu opening as a bottom sheet. Nothing
  is pinned to the top, so the full height of a phone goes to the photography.

  Replaces the fixed chip bar + quartered Explore overlay. The Explore panels'
  merchant settings are kept and re-used as the sheet's two cards, so nobody
  has to re-pick images in the editor.

  Panel media goes through image_url | image_tag so the focal point set in the
  editor is honoured (CLAUDE.md rule 7).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign shop_url = section.settings.shop_url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url
  assign map_url = section.settings.map_url | default: 'https://map.bushriding.cc'
  assign shop_label = section.settings.shop_label | default: 'Shop'
  assign map_label = section.settings.map_label | default: 'BUSH MAP™'
  assign menu_label = section.settings.menu_label | default: 'Menu'
  assign discover_label = section.settings.discover_label | default: 'The launch'
  assign discover_url = section.settings.discover_url | default: shop_url
  assign wordmark_text = section.settings.wordmark | default: shop.name
  assign events_api = section.settings.events_api | default: 'https://map-api.bushriding.cc'
  assign events_url = section.settings.events_url | default: 'https://map.bushriding.cc/events/'
  assign show_next_ride = section.settings.next_ride_enabled

  comment
    Journal and About are only drawn when they resolve. A blog that has not been
    created, or an About page that has not been written, would otherwise put a
    404 in the primary navigation of every page on the site — the same rule
    alp-legal-links already applies to the fine print.
  endcomment
  assign journal_blog = blogs[section.settings.journal_handle]
  assign journal_url = section.settings.journal_url
  if journal_url == blank and journal_blog != blank
    assign journal_url = journal_blog.url
  endif
  assign journal_label = section.settings.journal_label | default: 'Journal'

  assign about_page = pages[section.settings.about_handle]
  assign about_url = section.settings.about_url
  if about_url == blank and about_page != blank
    assign about_url = about_page.url
  endif
  assign about_label = section.settings.about_label | default: 'About'

  comment
    Which nav row wears the mist bar. Product counts as Shop: a product is
    somewhere inside the catalogue, and leaving the rail unmarked there reads
    as a page that belongs to nothing.
  endcomment
  assign nav_here = ''
  case template.name
    when 'index'
      assign nav_here = 'home'
    when 'collection', 'product', 'list-collections', 'search'
      assign nav_here = 'shop'
    when 'blog', 'article'
      assign nav_here = 'journal'
    when 'page'
      if about_page != blank and page.handle == about_page.handle
        assign nav_here = 'about'
      endif
  endcase
-%}

{%- capture nav_rows -%}
  <a class="alp-rail__link{% if nav_here == 'home' %} is-on{% endif %}" href="{{ routes.root_url }}"
    {% if nav_here == 'home' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %} data-alp-menu-link>Home</a>
  <a class="alp-rail__link{% if nav_here == 'shop' %} is-on{% endif %}" href="{{ shop_url }}"
    {% if nav_here == 'shop' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %} data-alp-menu-link>{{ shop_label | escape }}</a>
  {%- if journal_url != blank -%}
    <a class="alp-rail__link{% if nav_here == 'journal' %} is-on{% endif %}" href="{{ journal_url }}"
      {% if nav_here == 'journal' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %} data-alp-menu-link>{{ journal_label | escape }}</a>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if about_url != blank -%}
    <a class="alp-rail__link{% if nav_here == 'about' %} is-on{% endif %}" href="{{ about_url }}"
      {% if nav_here == 'about' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %} data-alp-menu-link>{{ about_label | escape }}</a>
  {%- endif -%}
  <a class="alp-rail__link" href="{{ map_url }}" data-alp-menu-link>{{ map_label | escape }}</a>
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- capture cart_row -%}
  <a class="alp-rail__cart" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}" data-alp-menu-link>
    Cart ({{ cart.item_count }})
  </a>
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- comment -%} ── Desktop: the rail ──────────────────────────────────────── {%- endcomment -%}
<header
  class="alp alp-rail"
  data-alp-rail
  data-alp-events-api="{{ events_api | escape }}"
  data-alp-events-url="{{ events_url | escape }}"
  data-alp-map-url="{{ map_url | escape }}"
>
  <div class="alp-rail__top">
    <a class="alp-rail__wordmark" href="{{ routes.root_url }}">
      {%- if section.settings.logo != blank -%}
        {{ section.settings.logo | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: class: 'alp-rail__mark', alt: wordmark_text, loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high' }}
      {%- else -%}
        <img
          class="alp-rail__mark"
          src="{{ 'wordmark-olive.svg' | asset_url }}"
          alt="{{ wordmark_text | escape }}"
          width="1273"
          height="543"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        >
      {%- endif -%}
    </a>

    <nav class="alp-rail__nav" aria-label="Primary">{{ nav_rows }}</nav>

    {%- comment -%}
      The rail's changing lower half. Each template's own section renders into
      this slot — see the per-page work in alpine-collection-grid, main-product,
      main-blog and the About page. Empty is a valid state (the home page has
      nothing to put here).
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="alp-rail__slot" data-alp-rail-slot></div>
  </div>

  <div class="alp-rail__foot">
    {%- if template.name == 'cart' -%}
      <span class="alp-nr__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="alp-rail__eyebrow">Cart</p>
      <p class="alp-rail__summary">
        {{ cart.item_count }} {% if cart.item_count == 1 %}item{% else %}items{% endif %}
        {%- if cart.item_count > 0 %} · {{ cart.total_price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}{% endif -%}
      </p>
    {%- else -%}
      {%- if show_next_ride -%}{%- render 'alp-next-ride', variant: 'rail' -%}{%- endif -%}
      {{ cart_row }}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</header>

{%- comment -%} ── Mobile: the floating chips ─────────────────────────────── {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="alp alp-fab" data-alp-fab>
  <button class="alp-chip alp-chip--flare alp-fab__btn" type="button" data-alp-menu-open aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="alp-menu-overlay">
    {{ menu_label | escape }} <span class="alp-glyph">✦</span>
  </button>
  <a class="alp-chip alp-fab__btn" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">
    Cart{% if cart.item_count > 0 %} {{ cart.item_count }}{% endif %}
  </a>
</div>

{%- comment -%} ── Mobile: the menu sheet ─────────────────────────────────── {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="alp alp-sheet" id="alp-menu-overlay" data-alp-menu aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="alp-sheet__scrim" data-alp-menu-close></div>

  <div class="alp-sheet__panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Menu">
    <div class="alp-sheet__bar">
      <img
        class="alp-sheet__mark"
        src="{{ 'wordmark-olive.svg' | asset_url }}"
        alt="{{ wordmark_text | escape }}"
        width="1273"
        height="543"
        loading="lazy"
      >
      <button class="alp-sheet__close" type="button" data-alp-menu-close aria-label="Close menu">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="alp-sheet__scroll">
      {%- if show_next_ride -%}{%- render 'alp-next-ride', variant: 'panel' -%}{%- endif -%}

      <nav class="alp-sheet__nav" aria-label="Primary">
        {{ nav_rows }}
        {{ cart_row }}
      </nav>

      <div class="alp-sheet__cards">
        <a class="alp-sheet__card" href="{{ discover_url }}" data-alp-menu-link>
          {%- if section.settings.discover_image != blank -%}
            {{ section.settings.discover_image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: class: 'alp-sheet__media', loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}
          {%- else -%}
            <span class="alp-sheet__media alp-sheet__media--ph"></span>
          {%- endif -%}
          <span class="alp-sheet__cardlabel">{{ discover_label | escape }}</span>
        </a>

        {%- comment -%}
          The second card is the latest dispatch — the article itself, with its
          own featured image, rather than a picture someone has to keep in sync
          by hand. Falls back to the Explore menu's old Shop panel image when
          there is no blog yet.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign latest = journal_blog.articles.first -%}
        {%- if latest != blank -%}
          <a class="alp-sheet__card" href="{{ latest.url }}" data-alp-menu-link>
            {%- if latest.image != blank -%}
              {{ latest.image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: class: 'alp-sheet__media', loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="alp-sheet__media alp-sheet__media--ph"></span>
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="alp-sheet__cardlabel">Latest dispatch</span>
          </a>
        {%- elsif section.settings.menu_shop_image != blank -%}
          <a class="alp-sheet__card" href="{{ shop_url }}" data-alp-menu-link>
            {{ section.settings.menu_shop_image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: class: 'alp-sheet__media', loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}
            <span class="alp-sheet__cardlabel">{{ shop_label | escape }}</span>
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <div class="alp-sheet__columns">
        {%- capture legal_links -%}{%- render 'alp-legal-links', menu_link: true -%}{%- endcapture -%}
        {%- if legal_links != blank -%}
          <div class="alp-sheet__col">
            <p class="alp-rail__eyebrow">The fine print</p>
            <ul role="list">{{ legal_links }}</ul>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.instagram_url != blank or section.settings.strava_url != blank or section.settings.youtube_url != blank -%}
          <div class="alp-sheet__col">
            <p class="alp-rail__eyebrow">Follow</p>
            <ul role="list">
              {%- if section.settings.instagram_url != blank -%}
                <li><a href="{{ section.settings.instagram_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a></li>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if section.settings.strava_url != blank -%}
                <li><a href="{{ section.settings.strava_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Strava</a></li>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if section.settings.youtube_url != blank -%}
                <li><a href="{{ section.settings.youtube_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube</a></li>
              {%- endif -%}
            </ul>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- if shop.customer_accounts_enabled -%}
        <p class="alp-sheet__account">
          {%- if customer -%}
            <a href="{{ routes.account_url }}" data-alp-menu-link>{{ customer.first_name | escape }} — my account</a>
          {%- else -%}
            <a href="{{ routes.account_login_url }}" data-alp-menu-link>Sign in</a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Bush Riding header",
  "tag": "div",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "logo", "label": "Logo", "info": "The brush wordmark in the rail and the menu sheet. Leave empty to use the olive artwork that ships with the theme — both sit on bone, so the mark must be dark." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "wordmark", "label": "Wordmark", "default": "Bush Riding™", "info": "The logo's alt text. Leave blank to use the store name." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Navigation" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "shop_label", "label": "Shop label", "default": "Shop" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "shop_url", "label": "Shop URL", "info": "Defaults to the all-products catalog." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "journal_label", "label": "Journal label", "default": "Journal" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "journal_handle", "label": "Journal blog handle", "default": "journal", "info": "Which blog the Journal link points at. The link is hidden entirely if no blog with this handle exists." },
    { "type": "url", "id": "journal_url", "label": "Journal URL override" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "about_label", "label": "About label", "default": "About" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "about_handle", "label": "About page handle", "default": "about", "info": "Hidden entirely if no page with this handle exists." },
    { "type": "url", "id": "about_url", "label": "About URL override" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "map_label", "label": "Map label", "default": "BUSH MAP™" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "map_url", "label": "Map URL", "info": "Defaults to https://map.bushriding.cc." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Next ride" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "next_ride_enabled", "label": "Show the next ride", "default": true, "info": "Pulled live from the Bush Map events feed. The block hides itself when there is no upcoming ride, so it can never show a stale date." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "events_api", "label": "Events API base", "default": "https://map-api.bushriding.cc", "info": "The routes worker that serves /events. Clear this to switch the next-ride block off entirely." },
    { "type": "url", "id": "events_url", "label": "Events page URL", "info": "Where the next-ride link goes when the event has no route on the map. Defaults to the map's events index." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Menu sheet (mobile)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "menu_label", "label": "Menu chip label", "default": "Menu" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "discover_label", "label": "First card label", "default": "The launch" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "discover_url", "label": "First card link", "info": "Defaults to the Shop URL." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "discover_image", "label": "First card image", "info": "Set the crop via the image's focal point (edit the image in the picker)." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "menu_shop_image", "label": "Fallback second card image", "info": "Only used before the journal has its first article — the second card is normally the latest dispatch." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Follow" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "youtube_url", "label": "YouTube URL" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "strava_url", "label": "Strava URL" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "instagram_url", "label": "Instagram URL" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
